    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University brought together its Centres of Excellence in Women and Child Health from Pakistan and East Africa for a unique cross-continental exchange titled \"One Vision\", reaffirming the University's commitment to improving the lives of women, mothers and children across generations. The gathering highlighted how challenges in maternal, newborn and child health transcend borders, and how shared solutions can accelerate progress.",
